OL,3,GNEWSAFears new cycle lane will cause
OL,4,Ahuge disruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new cycle lane could cause long
OL,7,Fdelays and reduce much-needed on-street
OL,8,Fparking, residents fear.
OL,10,FThe cycle spine is a #48m project which
OL,11,Fwill connect Bishops Cleeve in north
OL,12,FGloucestershire to Stroud in the south,
OL,13,Falso linking Gloucester and Cheltenham.
OL,15,FGloucestershire County Council said the
OL,16,Fscheme was designed to "help reduce
OL,17,Fcarbon emissions and encourage active
OL,18,Ftravel" and has proposed extending the
OL,19,Froute into south Gloucester from St Ann
OL,20,FWay to Cole Avenue, through Linden,
OL,21,FPodsmead and Tuffley.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
