OL,3,GNEWSAFears new cycle lane will cause
OL,4,Ahuge disruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents have complained that this
OL,7,Fextension will reduce on-street parking
OL,8,Fspaces and could increase congestion
OL,9,Falong narrow streets.
